{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99868","id":2706956720,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DnzhD","number":99868,"title":"Allow non-tres text resources (for GDScript and C# currently) to store metadata","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2024-11-30T08:33:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:34:45Z","closed_at":"2024-12-11T01:46:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99868","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99868.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99868.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The problem comes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99748#issuecomment-2504004205\r\nAfter days of work, I finally figured out a solution.\r\n\r\n# `.gdmeta` file\r\nLike `.uid` files, `.gdmeta` files are actually resuffixed config files (sorry but I don't know how to parse a format data file in a better way...), which is placed in the same directory as the resource files. When a text resource (referring to a resource that is stored directly with its texts) contains metadata and is going to store its data, a `.gdmeta` file will be created in the same directory of the resource file. When a resource has no metadata while its metadata file exists, the metadata file will be removed.\r\n\r\n# Metadata files for `GDScript` and `C#`\r\nCurrently, this PR only supports GDScript and C# to store metadata files, and the other types of text resources will be allowed soon by future PRs of mine or other contributors.\r\nIn their definitions of formatters' `save()` and `load()`, there will be `save_meta()` and `load_meta()` respectively in the middle-bottom of the method body, which are defined in `ResourceFormatSaver` and `ResourceFormatLoader` correspondingly.\r\n\r\n# Limitations\r\nCurrently, I'm not sure whether the method `load_meta()` should be written like that, or should be written with the background of multi-thread programming (i.e. `Mutex` or something else for multi-thread work). If you have better solution, feel free to share yours in this pr. :)\r\n\r\n# WIPs\r\n- [x] Add `.gdmeta` file for storing metadatas of text resources, and add meta `save_meta()` and `load_meta()` for operations of the file.\r\n- [x] Allow `GDScript` and `C#` script resources to store metadata.\r\n- [ ] Local test and feedback solution.","closed_by":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99868/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}